sequenceDiagram
  participant A as AI Agent 90
  participant C as CLI 30
  participant G as Gateway Module 20
  participant P as Permission Manager 70
  participant E as Browser Extension 10
  participant T as Browser Tab 40
  participant L as Audit Log 60

  A->>C: abg read/click/fill
  C->>G: JSON request over UDS
  G->>P: check permitted tab
  alt tab permitted
    G->>E: WebSocket command
    E->>T: CDP or structured operation
    T-->>E: result
    E-->>G: result
    G->>L: append operation audit entry
    G-->>C: JSON response
    C-->>A: command output
  else tab not permitted
    G->>L: append rejected request
    G-->>C: error
    C-->>A: error output
  end
